{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixAutomaton"},"abstract":[{"text":"The suffix automaton of a text: the smallest deterministic automaton that accepts every suffix","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of it, whose paths from the start state spell exactly the text’s substrings (Blumer et al.,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“The Smallest Automaton Recognizing the Subwords of a Text”, 1985).","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixAutomaton\/CommonSubstring","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixAutomaton\/TransitionsView-swift.struct"],"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixAutomaton\/init(_:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixAutomaton\/count","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixAutomaton\/distinctSubstringCount","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixAutomaton\/stateCount","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixAutomaton\/transitionCount","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixAutomaton\/transitionsView-swift.property"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixAutomaton\/contains(_:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixAutomaton\/firstOccurrence(of:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixAutomaton\/hasSuffix(_:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/documentation\/SuffixStructures\/SuffixAutomaton\/longestCommonSubstring(with:)","doc:\/\/SuffixStructures\/docum